  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/EP.jpg\" title=\"The Embercore Portal\"><img alt=\"The Embercore Portal\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"442\" src=\"/images/EP.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/EP.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>The Embercore Portal</b></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><b>This is the outpost to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>. There is also a portal leading back to level 5 of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<p>NPC's found at The Embercore Portal\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ol'_Chuck_Pail\" title=\"Ol' Chuck Pail\">Ol' Chuck Pail</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wally_Wanka\" title=\"Wally Wanka\">Wally Wanka</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p>Both give lots of <i>interesting</i> quests!\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
